WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.590
Six years of lawfare for telling the truth.

00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:06.159
I reported foreign interference inside the Canadian military.

00:00:06.159 --> 00:00:10.454
Instead of investigating the threat, they spent six years trying to destroy me.

00:00:10.454 --> 00:00:15.181
A family member was killed by a foreign national connected to the operation I reported.

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:19.250
My sister lost her unborn child from the trauma of her partner's death.

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:24.170
CFNIS — the Canadian Forces National Investigation Service — investigated me.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:25.272
Not the threat.

00:00:25.272 --> 00:00:25.977
Me.

00:00:25.977 --> 00:00:27.886
The pattern is always the same.

00:00:27.886 --> 00:00:30.818
A person with evidence reports through official channels.

00:00:30.818 --> 00:00:35.204
The institution redirects all resources toward destroying the person who reported.

00:00:35.204 --> 00:00:37.909
The original crime is never investigated.

00:00:37.909 --> 00:00:39.170
Six years.

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:40.693
That is how long it took.

00:00:40.693 --> 00:00:42.343
Weaponized psychiatry.

00:00:42.343 --> 00:00:46.124
The military mental health system was used not to treat — but to discredit.

00:00:46.124 --> 00:00:51.352
If you can label a whistleblower as mentally unstable, you don't need to address their evidence.

00:00:51.352 --> 00:00:53.829
The Soviet Union perfected this technique.

00:00:53.829 --> 00:00:55.488
Canada adopted it.

00:00:55.488 --> 00:01:01.011
Seventy-six thousand seven hundred and seven Canadians killed through MAID since 2016.

00:01:01.011 --> 00:01:06.786
Veteran suicide rates one point four to one point nine times higher than the civilian population.

00:01:06.786 --> 00:01:12.079
Forty-seven percent of MAID Track 2 recipients reported loneliness as a source of suffering.

00:01:12.079 --> 00:01:17.931
One hundred and forty-nine MAID deaths in 2024 of people who could have received disability support instead.

00:01:17.931 --> 00:01:20.534
What I am asking for is not complicated.

00:01:20.534 --> 00:01:23.704
Investigate the crimes documented in these records.

00:01:23.704 --> 00:01:26.579
Apply Section 504 of the Criminal Code.

00:01:26.579 --> 00:01:30.999
Hold the officials accountable who are named in the evidence — not the person who found it.
